cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it, and cite the source papers for any finding that matters to your work."
type: dataset
title: "POTS findings v1.2, package 3 of 5: EDS and hypermobility, ME/CFS, MCAS, fibromyalgia, IBS, small fiber neuropathy and RCCX genes, part 2 of 2 (33,830 findings, 2,589 papers)"
version: "tier2b-v1.2"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/erinmagennis/pots-findings"
authors:
  - family-names: "Magennis"
    given-names: "Erin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9013-8052"
abstract: >-
  Package 3 of 5. 33,830 structured findings machine-extracted from
  2,589 papers (2020-2026) covering EDS/hypermobility, ME/CFS, MCAS, RCCX genes, fibromyalgia, IBS, small-fiber neuropathy, patient-generated evidence, gastroparesis.
  One block of a five-way partition of an 11,519-paper, 148,186-finding corpus of the POTS,
  dysautonomia and comorbid-condition literature. The five packages share no PubMed record; per-package counts sum exactly to the corpus totals. 14 studies appear as a preprint in one package and as the published version in another; annotations/paper_flags.csv links them.
  Scientific fidelity is unmeasured: all QA verifies well-formedness, not correct
  interpretation of sources. Not medical advice.
keywords:
  - "POTS"
  - "postural orthostatic tachycardia syndrome"
  - "dysautonomia"
  - "ME/CFS"
